Faucet tap water inlet blanking plug with M10 10mm thread size. Blanking plug is suitable to use with all bathroom or kitchen mixer taps with M10 water inlet, where one of the water inlets (either hot or cold) needs to be blanked, as only one water inlet is to be used. Blanking plug is equipped with two rubber washers for a better seal.

Specification:
- Thread size: M10 10mm;
- Length: 32mm;
- Hex size: 10mm;
- Material: Brass;
- Two rubber washers included;

